{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19223","headline":"张郎中籍远寄长句开缄之日已及新秋因举目前仰酬高韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"张郎中籍远寄长句开缄之日已及新秋因举目前仰酬高韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫词客寄新篇，清似湘灵促柱弦。\n京邑旧游劳梦想，历阳秋色正澄鲜。\n云衔日脚成山雨，风驾潮头入渚田。\n对此独吟还独酌，知音不见思怆然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}